&lt;p&gt;At flaconi, we believe that&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;lila-hg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;fuels creativity, innovation and growth. It thrives in all its forms of beauty. Our team is a mosaic of individuals from different backgrounds, cultures and life journeys, all united by a shared passion for beauty. Our commitment is grounded in our core values, particularly&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;lila-hg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#trustinpeople&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. We hold ourselves accountable for creating an environment where every employee feels honestly valued, heard and empowered to contribute their unique perspectives to foster belonging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;flaconi is an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;lila-hg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and welcomes and encourages all qualified&amp;nbsp; from all backgrounds and identities, regardless of ethnicity, race, gender identity, migration background, national origin, disability status, sexual orientation, religion, or age to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require specific support during the application or interview process – e.g. live captions, more time for the interview or the task in a different format – just let us know so that we can adapt the process accordingly. We will do our best to make this possible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking a (Senior) Data Scientist (all genders) to join a dynamic team of five within our DATA department. You&#39;ll dive into diverse challenges including training and deploying machine learning models, developing Generative AI and Agentic AI solutions, and statistical modeling. We believe in flat hierarchies, which means you&#39;ll work closely with colleagues of various seniorities in a fun environment. You&#39;ll play a key role in extracting valuable insights and developing data and AI solutions to optimize our e-commerce platform across Europe, taking end-to-end ownership of your projects and collaborating closely with business stakeholders along the way. Your contributions will have a direct impact on business decisions and process efficiency across a wide spectrum of unique use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;Employ statistical techniques and machine learning algorithms for regression, classification, and clustering (e.g., Gradient Boosting, Random Forest, Hierarchical Clustering, ensemble methods).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Develop and productionalize Generative AI and Agentic AI solutions alongside modern NLP techniques using transformer architectures (e.g., BERT, GPT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Utilize time-series forecasting methods (e.g., ARIMA, LSTM, DeepAR, Prophet) for predictive modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Conduct exploratory data analysis (EDA), advanced feature engineering, and dimensionality reduction (PCA, t-SNE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;Develop and implement deep learning models in PyTorch, TensorFlow, or Keras while leveraging transfer learning strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;Showcase your skills across key e-commerce data science use cases including demand forecasting, churn and CLTV modeling, pricing, customer segmentation, recommender systems, and personalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot;&gt;Handle large-scale datasets using distributed computing frameworks (Apache Spark) on a tech stack comprising Python (PySpark, pandas, NumPy, scikit-learn, LightGBM), SQL, Databricks (Data Lakehouse &amp;amp; ML platform), AWS (S3, Lambda, EC2, SageMaker, Bedrock), GitHub, and AI-augmented tools (Claude, Copilot) while collaborating directly to proactively address stakeholder business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;Bring a minimum of 3 years of hands-on experience in developing and deploying machine learning solutions for real-world business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrate background exposure to &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;35&quot;&gt;e-commerce (ideal)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot;&gt;fintech&lt;/strong&gt;, or fast-paced &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;78&quot;&gt;agency&lt;/strong&gt; environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrate hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;37&quot;&gt;Databricks as a Data &amp;amp; AI platform (required)&lt;/strong&gt; alongside cloud platforms such as AWS, GCP, or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot;&gt;Prove hands-on experience in building, productionalizing, and deploying Generative AI or Agentic AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot;&gt;Apply hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;MLOps practices and tools (required)&lt;/strong&gt; for end-to-end model lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,6,0&quot;&gt;Possess a strong grasp of core data science principles to select the most appropriate techniques, combined with advanced proficiency in SQL, Python (PySpark, scikit-learn, NumPy, matplotlib, pandas), and AI-augmented development tools (Claude, Copilot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,7,0&quot;&gt;Communicate exceptionally in English (written and verbal) to articulate complex concepts to non-technical stakeholders, driving projects with full end-to-end ownership as a collaborative team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our employees matter to us&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer you a permanent contract and cover the costs for your Deutschland ticket.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-life balance&lt;/strong&gt;: 29 vacation days plus additional days off on the 24th and 31st December, flexible working hours, up to three days of working from home per week, working abroad options, paid sabbatical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flaconi Academy&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively shape your own career path by taking advantage of our internal and external training opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about your well being&lt;/strong&gt;: We want to support you also during difficult times. For this, we offer you and your close relatives counseling sessions with mental health professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flaconi fitness&lt;/strong&gt;: a wide range of sports options &amp;amp; discounts on memberships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family first:&lt;/strong&gt; Our “emergency-daycare” is there for you in out-of-the-ordinary situations to look after your child on site at our office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thinking about tomorrow together&lt;/strong&gt;: flaconi subsidizes your savings contribution to the company pension scheme with an additional 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A comfortable working space with everything you need&lt;/strong&gt;: High end technical equipment, fruits and drinks, no dress code and dogs are welcome in our office!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other perks&lt;/strong&gt;: Great discounts in our online shop as well with our partner companies, cool team events &amp;amp; company parties!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out all benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.flaconi.de/karriere/culture/&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Founded in 2011 as one of the first online perfumeries, flaconi is honored to work with more than 700 people from 60 different nations at the flaconi headquarters in Berlin-Charlottenburg and its fulfillment center in Halle.&amp;nbsp;Shape our company’s success with us and apply now online! We look forward to receiving your complete application documents including your earliest starting date and salary expectations.&lt;u&gt;flaconi will not accept unsolicited resumes from any source (e.g. recruitment agency) other than directly from a candidate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;AI Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use AI-powered tools to streamline and support individual steps in our recruiting process. For example, these tools help our recruiting team identify suitable candidates, prioritize applications, and gain insights relevant to recruiting. The AI does not make any hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed and evaluated by people, and all hiring decisions are made under human supervision and responsibility. Our AI system is regularly reviewed for potential biases and holds ISO 42001 certification for AI governance. If you have any questions about our use of AI or would like an explanation of the criteria, please feel free to contact our Talent Acquisition team at ----- at any time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The offered salary will always be within this range and is based on the outcomes of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary range (annual brutto)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€60.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€80.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cresta unlocks the true potential of the customer experience, turning every conversation into a competitive advantage. Cresta’s unified AI platform combines conversational AI agents, real-time human agent augmentation, and comprehensive conversation intelligence to drive revenue and efficiency gains across every channel. The world’s leading companies, including United Airlines, Cox Communications, and Marriott, use Cresta to power world-class customer experiences every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Born from the Stanford AI Lab, Cresta has raised more than $270 million from the world’s leading investors, including a16z, Greylock, and Sequoia. Cresta’s leadership includes some of the leading minds in AI today. Our CEO, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/pingwu/&quot;&gt;Ping Wu&lt;/a&gt;, founded and led Google&#39;s Contact Center AI and Vertex AI platforms before joining Cresta to build the future of AI-driven customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the next few years, AI is going to redefine how people all over the world interact with businesses every day. Come build that future at Cresta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a diligent and detail-oriented Software Engineer in Test to join our engineering team in Berlin, Germany. This role will be crucial in ensuring the robustness, scalability, and high quality of our software solutions and will be highly focused on building, expanding, and maintaining our automated testing ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;While strong manual testing instincts are important, this role is designed for someone who will spend the majority of their time writing code, advancing automation, and developing internal tools. The ideal candidate is someone who can independently identify what and how to test, take ownership of impactful projects, and help elevate quality across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and execute comprehensive test plans and test cases for new and existing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identify ambiguities or gaps in product specifications and propose improvements to ensure testability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Automate key scenarios using our Playwright-based test framework (TypeScript), with a focus on reliability and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Perform manual exploratory testing, particularly for complex, high-impact features or areas with low automation ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analyze and communicate test results, triaging issues with clear, actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Maintain and evolve testing standards, procedures, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Set up and manage testing environments to mirror production usage patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Investigate customer-reported issues, including log analysis (e.g., from Datadog/Grafana), reproduction steps, and severity assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with developers and product managers to drive quality from feature design through release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Contribute to release decisions with risk assessments and test coverage summaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to elevate quality across the SDLC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identify and advocate for opportunities to expand test coverage across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;BS/MS in Computer Science, Engineering, or equivalent technical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in software QA within SaaS, preferably in customer engagement or contact center platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong track record in creating and executing both manual and automated test strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proficiency in automation frameworks (e.g., Playwright, Cypress) and modern development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of QA methodologies, processes, and CI/CD practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Attention to detail with a bias toward risk-based testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and debugging skills, including backend and frontend issue investigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to think like an end-user and test accordingly, especially when product requirements are minimal or evolving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills and the confidence to constructively advocate for quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring peers or contributing to testing infrastructure is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation for this position includes a base salary, equity, and a variety of benefits. Actual salaries will be based on candidate-specific factors, including experience, skills, and location, as well as applicable local minimum pay requirements. We are actively hiring for this role in Berlin. For further details, please consult your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our use of AI in recruiting:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We may use AI tools in our recruiting process, which require human review and oversight. If you have questions about our use of AI or wish to opt out, please contact &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- (if you are opting out, please use the subject ‘Opt-Out’ in your email).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recording &amp;amp; AI transcription:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We do not authorize candidates to record or use AI transcription of any interview by phone, notetaker app, AI glasses, or other device. Candidates may request an exception or accommodation for review during the interview process as needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruiting impersonation scams:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Cresta recruiting email communications will always come from the ----- domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Cresta via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Site Reliability Engineer (Apprentice) - France&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Horizon Trading Solutions ?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une Fintech spécialisée dans la conception d’une plateforme facilitant les différentes activités de trading sur les marchés financiers électroniques (automatisation de certaines activités (Market Making, Algo Trading...), gestion des ordres et exécutions de manière optimale (Agency Trading, Order and Execution Management System…) ,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un logiciel à la fine pointe de la technologie déployée sur site ou en Managed Services ,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une roadmap produit ambitieuse : Machine Learning, IA, Crypto Currencies, Low Latency…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une société à taille humaine (1 20 collaborateurs) où vous pouvez faire une différence ,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une société internationale présente dans 6 pays pour servir des clients répartis sur 26 pays ,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une société engagée : certifié B-Corp, partenaire de Planet Tech’care, Ethical IA et Lakaa , fond de dotation ,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une société reconnue dans son domaine : Best Sell Side OMS 2025, Best Multi-Asset Trading System 2025, Best trading solution for listed securities 2022 et 2023...&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ce que vous ferez chez nous (Spoiler : c&#39;est passionnant techniquement !)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concevoir et mettre en œuvre une infrastructure performante et évolutive :&lt;/strong&gt; participez à la création et au déploiement d&#39;infrastructures critiques pour notre offre de services managés, intégrant hébergement, connectivité aux échanges et gestion des données de marché.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Déployer des solutions robustes et optimisées :&lt;/strong&gt; travaillez sur des environnements variés (on-premises, colocation, cloud) dans une infrastructure distribuée mondiale, répondant aux exigences de performances élevées et de latence minimale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moderniser notre écosystème technologique :&lt;/strong&gt; migrez des services existants vers une architecture basée sur des microservices et des conteneurs (Docker, Kubernetes), tout en améliorant notre pile de déploiement et d&#39;intégration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Garantir la fiabilité des plateformes :&lt;/strong&gt; automatisez les tâches de maintenance, mettez en place un monitoring en temps réel, effectuez des vérifications proactives et assurez les mises à jour et correctifs nécessaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Renforcer la sécurité de nos systèmes :&lt;/strong&gt; déployez des solutions innovantes pour protéger nos plateformes hébergées et assurez leur conformité aux standards de sécurité, SOC2 notamment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veiller au respect des processus :&lt;/strong&gt; appliquez rigoureusement les procédures de gestion des changements (CAB, &quot;validation à 4 yeux&quot;, gestion d&#39;accès temporaire).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partager et promouvoir les meilleures pratiques :&lt;/strong&gt; participez activement à la sensibilisation technologique, à la normalisation des outils et méthodes, et collaborez avec des experts dans un environnement Agile et DevOps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborer dans un cadre international :&lt;/strong&gt; échangez avec des équipes réparties dans plusieurs fuseaux horaires et intervenez sur des projets mondiaux impliquant Horizon, ses clients et partenaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Vos indispensables :&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La volonté de travailler du dimanche au vendredi inclus afin d’assurer une couverture optimale pour nos clients ,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Administration des systèmes Linux (RHEL) et scripting (bash, python, Gitlab , Ansible ).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
